        ns1:page 1 ;
        ns1:text "2. Maximum Occupancy per Zone Zone Max Persons Enforcement Production Area 12 WARNING above 10; CRITICAL above 12 Server Room 2 CRITICAL above 2; access badge required General Warehouse 4 WARNING above 3 Main Entrance 8 Monitoring only Chemical Storage 4 CRITICAL above 4; hazmat training required — see RULE-CHM01-03 R&D Lab 6 WARNING above 5; precision experiments may be disturbed Cafeteria 20 Monitoring only — occupant comfort" .

